id: pm-8xgg7i
title: "pm close clears the assignee but leaves claim_principal, so closed claimed items keep an active owner"
description: "`pm close` ended ownership only halfway. `clearCloseAssignee` in `src/sdk/lifecycle/close.ts` deleted `assignee` and left `claim_principal`, so every claimed item that was closed kept an active claim principal in its projection, and only a separate `pm release` (which since pm-bnrndo clears both fields on terminal items) removed it. CodeRabbit's review of PR #1635 found it on pm-m6ig79. The same residue was on six closed items in the tracker.\n\nFix: closure clears both `assignee` and `claim_principal` in the same recorded transition, and reports each cleared field in `changed_fields`."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: lifecycle,ownership,review
created_at: "2026-10-31T09:46:45.031Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-31T15:52:49.264Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-31T09:47:57.457Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-31T09:47:57.457Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: "pm close removes both assignee and claim_principal from a claimed item in one recorded transition and reports both in changed_fields; a regression test claims, closes and asserts neither field remains; the closed tracker items carrying a stale claim_principal are released through the CLI"
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: clearCloseAssignee in src/sdk/lifecycle/close.ts now deletes both assignee and claim_principal and reports each cleared field in changed_fields; regression test in close-command.spec.ts; stale tracker claims released through the CLI.
expected_result: "Closing a claimed item leaves neither assignee nor claim_principal in its projection, in the same recorded transition."
actual_result: "Before the fix the close transition removed assignee only; pm-m6ig79 and four other closed items (pm-gh1549, pm-z8qd4k, pm-3j6it6, pm-qudvto) kept a claim_principal. After the fix the claim-then-close regression test passes and fails with close.ts restored; the five items were released through pm release and no closed item carries a claim_principal."
